id=hy300tweaks
name=HY300 Ultra (H726) Post-Root Tweaks
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=hoangphi01
description=Neutralizes the /system/xbin/hotacksu setuid-root backdoor (bind-mounts an empty 000 file over it), brings a custom launcher forward at boot (stock firmware hard-forces com.htc.magcubicos as HOME), autostarts a screen-mirroring receiver (PhairPlay) after boot, holds a Wi-Fi low-latency lock so the AIC8800 does not power-save and drop casts, and re-disables the BadBox/bloat packages (fake Play Store, droppers, OTA, bundled junk) for user 0 each boot since the read-only stock /product can re-enable them. Edit the package lists in service.sh and build wifilock.jar (scripts/HoldWifiLock.java) before installing.
